# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Copyright (C) 2026 David Hamner
# Hamnix Micro milestone 2 kernel test image for QEMU `mps2-an500`.
#
# A privileged "runner" thread executes the groups below in order.  Every
# check prints "PASS <name>" or "FAIL <name>"; each check() call site runs
# exactly once, so the harness (tests/run_all.sh) requires the number of PASS
# lines to equal the number of call sites.  The emulator exit status is the
# number of failed checks.
#
# Unprivileged code lives in tests/kt_user.ad and user/faults.ad.

